{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03149","headline":"登荆州城楼 · 张九龄","name":"登荆州城楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"天宇何其旷，江城坐自拘。\n层楼百余尺，迢递在西隅。\n暇日时登眺，荒郊临故都。\n累累见陈迹，寂寂想雄图。\n古往山川在，今来郡邑殊。\n北疆虽入郑，东距岂防吴。\n几代传荆国，当时敌陕郛。\n上流空有处，中土复何虞。\n枕席夷三峡，关梁豁五湖。\n承平无异境，守隘莫论夫。\n自罢金门籍，来参竹使符。\n端居向林薮，微尚在桑榆。\n直似王陵戆，非如甯武愚。\n今兹对南浦，乘雁与双凫。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张九龄","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03149.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03149","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}